        "result": "The August 2026 all-items index is 169.8; September 2025 is 164.9, versus August 2025 at 164.8. September 2025 headline CPI increased 0.1% monthly, gasoline 1.9% and travel tours 4.6%; the travel increase was unusual for September. Sources: https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/n1/daily-quotidien/260914/t001a-eng.htm ; https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/n1/daily-quotidien/251021/t001a-eng.htm ; https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/n1/daily-quotidien/251021/dq251021a-eng.htm?HPA=1"
